o ABC from the Goodman and Trujillo families quoted.  [ANALYST&nbsp- assesses a recession.] ", "segment_duration": 260, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 908004, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "oshPje5JNV", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-15", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 908003, "segment_id": "yGuglmWLsV", "segment_broadcast_id": "oshPje5JNV", "segment_title": "Campaign 2008 / Obama vs. McCain / Third Debate", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  The final presidential debate between Senators Barack Obama and John McCain introduced.  \n\n(Hofstra University: David Wright)  The last shot for McCain to make an impression with voters previewed; details given about what he will say about Obama.  [On ABC, OBAMA&nbsp- says McCain did not say it to his face.]  [On KMOX-AM \"The Mark Reardon Show,\" voice of McCAIN&nbsp- says he ensured it {the William Ayers link} will come up.]  \n\n(Hofstra University: Jake Tapper)  What Obama will argue in tonight's debate previewed.  [On the plane, campaign adviser David AXELROD&#134;- says we are not reinventing ourselves.]  [OBAMA&nbsp- says the Ayers link does not make sense.]  [September 10, OBAMA&nbsp- criticizes the McCain campaign.]  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson, George Stephanopoulos)  The hopes for McCain in tonight's debate, how McCain will press to force an error from Obama and the Obama strategy of not appearing to coast without making a mistake discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  ABC News coverage of the debate announced. ", "segment_duration": 270, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_star